## Incident Response

### Response Timeline

| Severity | Acknowledge | Update Frequency | Target Resolution |
|----------|-------------|------------------|-------------------|
| SEV1 | 5 minutes | 15 minutes | 4 hours |
| SEV2 | 15 minutes | 30 minutes | 8 hours |
| SEV3 | 30 minutes | 1 hour | 24 hours |
| SEV4 | 1 hour | 4 hours | 72 hours |

### Roles During Incident

| Role | Responsibility | Assigned |
|------|----------------|----------|
| Incident Commander (IC) | Overall coordination | On-call manager |
| Technical Lead | Investigation, resolution | On-call engineer |
| Communications Lead | Status updates | CS/Comms |
