## Postmortem Process

### Postmortem Requirements

| Severity | Postmortem Required | Timeline |
|----------|---------------------|----------|
| SEV1 | Yes (mandatory) | 3 business days |
| SEV2 | Yes (mandatory) | 5 business days |
| SEV3 | Optional | 7 business days |
| SEV4 | No | — |

### Postmortem Template

| Section | Content |
|---------|---------|
| Summary | Brief description |
| Timeline | Detailed chronology |
| Impact | Customers, duration, data |
| Root Cause | Why it happened |
| Contributing Factors | Related issues |
| Resolution | What fixed it |
| Action Items | Preventive measures |
| Lessons Learned | What to improve |

### Postmortem Principles

- **Blameless**: Focus on systems, not individuals
- **Thorough**: Understand full context
- **Actionable**: Specific, assigned improvements
- **Shared**: Distributed across teams
- **Followed Up**: Action items tracked

